{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","乱魂送葬"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤幽魂肆虐全场。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","召唤10道幽魂，幽魂会对随机敌人造成110% + 15% ATK伤害，持续10秒。幽魂造成伤害时，雪米拉会获得等同于伤害量50% + 5%的治疗，幽魂返回时，雪米拉会获得等同于伤害量50% + 5%的治疗，施放终极技能后，每名敌人累计受到15次及以上的伤害时，幽魂造成的伤害降低至50%。被动地，大招持续期间，通过“换命夺魂”凝聚的幽魂也会参与攻击。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":28,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":69,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":94,"end":99,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":32,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","幽魂造成的伤害提升至120% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","幽魂造成的伤害提升至130% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","幽魂造成的伤害提升至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","幽魂造成的伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","祭命宝珠"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对直线范围内的敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","雪米拉消耗当前生命的10%，从4格外的幽冥裂隙中召唤悲怆宝珠，对飞行路径上的敌人造成320% + 40% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":52,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":42,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至340% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至360% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至380% + 40% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","换命夺魂"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","消耗生命造成伤害，消耗幽魂将造成额外范围伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","雪米拉消耗当前生命的15%，对单个敌方单位造成其最大生命值24% + 3%真实伤害，最高不超过自身800% ATK。若雪米拉拥有幽魂，则消耗1道幽魂，牵引幽冥之力对目标及周围1格敌方造成其最大生命值20% + 2%真实伤害，最高不超过自身500% ATK。被动地，我方消耗的生命或护盾达到雪米拉生命上限的50%时，在雪米拉身侧凝聚1道幽魂，至多存在5道幽魂。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":102,"end":107,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":49,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":119,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","对单个敌方单位造成的最大生命值伤害提升至26% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","对单个敌方单位造成的最大生命值伤害提升至28% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","对单个敌方单位造成的最大生命值伤害提升至30% + 3%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身攻击回能，召唤3道幽魂后额外提升攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击回能提升24%，召唤3道幽魂后额外提升6%攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击回能提升32%，召唤3道幽魂后额外提升8%攻击回能。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身攻击回能提升40%，召唤3道幽魂后额外提升10%攻击回能。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","幽冥护身"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","将幽魂转化为护盾，溢出护盾将转化为全场范围伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","累计受到生命上限30%伤害或召唤幽魂达到上限后，会消耗1道幽魂生成护盾，持续5秒，护盾能够抵挡雪米拉250% ATK伤害，持续时间结束时，雪米拉将剩余的护盾能量宣泄而出，对全场敌人造成等同于剩余护盾量的伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":50,"end":58,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵挡的伤害提高至270% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","幽魂攻击时会额外造成目标最大生命值3%真实伤害，最高不超过自身90% ATK，并造成等同于伤害量的生命削减。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":31,"end":38,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":49,"end":53,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵挡的伤害提高至300% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","英雄单位死亡时，获得一道幽魂。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每个英雄单位死亡时，雪米拉额外获得1道幽魂。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","悲怆宝珠"]]}